 > **Note:** `mri` _only_ checks for unknown flags if `options.unknown` **and** `options.alias` are populated. Otherwise, everything will be accepted.
 
 
+#### options['--']
+Type: `Boolean`<br>
+Default: `false`
+
+When set, all arguments after a bare `--` are placed in `argv['--']` instead of `argv._`. The `'--'` key is always an array (empty if no `--` was given).
+
+```js
+mri(['a', '--foo', '--', 'b', 'c'], { '--': true });
+//=> { _:['a'], foo:true, '--':['b', 'c'] }
+```
+
+
 ## Comparisons
 
 #### minimist
